  "notes": "RWCU isolation and Reactor Building Emergency Ventilation initiation are noted as safety system responses but not modeled as separate FailureModes since they are direct expected responses to the same voltage transient, not a chained failure. No BACKED_UP_BY edge asserted since isolation signals are bypassable/manually overridable by design/procedure rather than an operable backup system being invoked during the inoperability window. Component boards X2/X5 modeled as PART_OF UPS 162A per explicit narrative structure (replaced as a pair within the UPS). Previous LER 2016-002-00 captured as stub per its stated title and cause (capacitor failure + low bypass transfer setpoint), distinct docket details not stated in narrative."
